  "body": "<!-- THESIS: The user-selected studies form one connected Mycelium, with learning and community equally prominent.\nOWN-WORLD: Soil brown, forest, cool sage and stone; bold Manrope; photographic layers, plant sculpture and clear library controls.\nSTORY: Discover permaculture, find a starting point, and connect with others on Common Ground.\nFIRST VIEWPORT: Farm's seedling and large headline at home; panoramic type on About; big left-aligned titles and layered media in libraries. Equal learning/community actions remain on home.\nFORM: User-selected Farm-to-Fauna composition, Interstellar About and study-derived libraries. Selection key: mycelium-selected-studies-2026-10-16.\nFINISH: unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the finish review, the verdict, and DESIGN.md --><a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n<header class=\"site-header\"><a aria-label=\"Mycelium home\" class=\"brand\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Mycelium\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"88\" loading=\"eager\" sizes=\"230px\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/d6b5b92b-logo-be405390b89c-400.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/d6b5b92b-logo-be405390b89c-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/d6b5b92b-logo-be405390b89c-400.webp 400w\" width=\"400\"/></a><button aria-controls=\"site-menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"menu-button\"><span>Menu</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button></header>\n<nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\" class=\"site-menu\" hidden=\"\" id=\"site-menu\"><div class=\"menu-links\"><a class=\"menu-route\" href=\"/videos/\"><span>Videos</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a aria-current=\"page\" class=\"menu-route current\" href=\"/courses/\"><span>Courses</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></pa